&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a high-impact Head of Sales to lead, scale, and synchronize our revenue efforts across two key pillars: Agencies and Direct Brands.&amp;nbsp;Reporting directly to the Country Manager of Singapore, you will be the architect of our sales strategy. You won&#39;t just be managing pipelines; you’ll be managing people—specifically leading our Agency Leads and Direct Brand Leads to ensure our market presence is cohesive and our revenue targets are smashed. This leadership role requires a seasoned professional who can engage C-suite stakeholders, develop high-impact partnerships, and deliver business results.&lt;/h2&gt;
