&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, coach, and elevate the current Agency and Direct Brand Leads. You are responsible for their professional growth and the collective output of their teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full sales funnel. From lead gen strategy to closing high-value contracts, you’ll ensure the engine is running lean and fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the &quot;voice of the market&quot; for our Product and Marketing teams to ensure our offerings remain competitive and our messaging hits the mark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Level Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Personally manage relationships with &quot;Big 6&quot; agency holding companies and C-suite stakeholders at Tier-1 brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Stack Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Audit and evolve our sales tech stack by integrating AI-driven tools to reduce &quot;manual grunt work&quot; for your leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
