&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Social Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Monthly, Quarterly, Annual MVP Awards (prizes up to 8,000USD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TGIF and other fun events at office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

